fni8-serve
==========

This project is a serving layer over the `fni8` W8A8 dp4a FlashAttention-2 kernels
for NVIDIA Volta (sm_70) / CMP 100-210.

Attributions
------------

* Serving-loop design (scheduler, paged KV cache, continuous batching) follows
  nano-vllm (https://github.com/GeeeekExplorer/nano-vllm), MIT License,
  Copyright (c) GeeeekExplorer. This project re-implements the design; it does not
  vendor nano-vllm source verbatim. Where engine modules are ported, the MIT notice
  is retained in-file.

* Depends on `fni8` (the CUDA/dp4a attention kernels + `.fni8` weight format +
  transport codec), BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2026 fni8 authors.

Quantization approaches informed by SDNQ (GPL-3.0, referenced for approach only, no
code), QuaRot / SageAttention / QLoRA-NF4 (studied for approach). No GPL code is
included in this project.
